    "bbox": [
      64.08,
      546.96,
      303.72,
      593.03
    ],
    "text": "IT is hereby notified under Section 7(1) of the LandAcquisition Act since the Government intends to acquire thefollowing lands required for the expansion of the Peradeniya- Badulla - Chenkaladi Road.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.070419311523438
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      72.96,
      609.36,
      235.53,
      619.43
    ],
    "text": "Description of the Land to be Acquired:",
