      434.16,
      555.99,
      468.23
    ],
    "text": "01. Lot No. 1392Name of the Land: \u2013; Claimant: Government; Encroacher:W. L. Nandasiri; Extent: 0.0003 Hectare.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.070419311523438
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      316.08,
      482.16,
      556.14,
      528.23
    ],
    "text": "All persons who claim rights, rights or any other kind ofgrounds of origin are the authorized persons or authorizedpersons of their respective places or may contact the BibilaDivisional Secretariat on the 28th October, 2019.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.070419311523438
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      316.08,
      542.16,
      556.24,
      600.23
    ],
    "text": "Further the nature of their rights and the nature of theirrights before the date of 21st October, 2019 should be notifiedto me by a document with two copies of the particulars of therequest for compensation and the manner of calculatingcompensation and the amount of compensation.",
